{"id":"npc:%E5%85%8B%E9%9B%B7%E6%A0%BC","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"塔拉人孩子，母亲是格兰妮，总是死死攥着手里的球。在身边塔拉人潜移默化的影响也开始帮助反抗组织与其背后的“深池”，直到小丘郡驻军炮击发生后，受孤身一人拦住罗南和“深池”士兵的琴柳影响而改变了想法。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情9-3 牌局、9-4 暗火四起、9-5 临界值等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_240.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_09-02_end","lineCount":12,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":95,"line":96,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":145,"line":146,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"他们总是打人。不过他们不用手，他们用脚踢。他们还会尖叫着，让我们滚远些。"},{"commandIndex":182,"line":183,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"我叫……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_09-03_beg","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":165,"line":166,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"——"},{"commandIndex":170,"line":171,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"叛徒！"},{"commandIndex":175,"line":176,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"叛徒！！！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_09-04_beg","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":334,"line":335,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"呃啊——"},{"commandIndex":338,"line":339,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"呜，痛……"},{"commandIndex":342,"line":343,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"……球。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_09-07_beg","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":67,"line":68,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":71,"line":72,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"我们不需要你！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_09-12_beg","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":370,"line":371,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"呜呜……啊……妈……妈……"},{"commandIndex":441,"line":442,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"……呜……哇……"},{"commandIndex":483,"line":484,"speaker":"克雷格","text":"呜……对……对不起……姐……姐……"}]}]}